137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 70 0 R
/T (This case study explores how computer graphics and virtual reality techniques can support an interior-design startup that wants customers to preview furniture in a home-like setting. The demonstration focuses on a red velvet chair and a brown leather sofa, using three core graphics operations: illumination modelling, texture and normal mapping, and window-to-viewport coordinate conversion.)
/E (This case study explores how computer graphics and virtual reality techniques can support an interior-design startup that wants customers to preview furniture in a home-like setting. The demonstration focuses on a red velvet chair and a brown leather sofa, using three core graphics operations: illumination modelling, texture and normal mapping, and window-to-viewport coordinate conversion.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
