/T (The report explains the mathematics, implementation workflow, user controls, optimization considerations and limitations. Screenshots from an earlier working Unity Play-mode build are included as practical evidence. They confirm that the earlier desktop showroom ran, but they do not verify later presentation changes, measured performance, or deployment on a phone, headset or WebXR platform. The prototype should therefore be understood as an educational desktop demonstration and a foundation for future AR development.)
/E (The report explains the mathematics, implementation workflow, user controls, optimization considerations and limitations. Screenshots from an earlier working Unity Play-mode build are included as practical evidence. They confirm that the earlier desktop showroom ran, but they do not verify later presentation changes, measured performance, or deployment on a phone, headset or WebXR platform. The prototype should therefore be understood as an educational desktop demonstration and a foundation for future AR development.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
