162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 71 0 R
/T (A compact desktop scene in Unity is used as a controlled learning environment. It contains a red chair, brown sofa, room elements, a window, simple props, adjustable lighting and on-screen controls. Scene objects are generated procedurally during Play mode. The purpose is to demonstrate and compare selected graphics principles; it is not intended to claim photorealistic material reproduction or complete device-based AR functionality. The implementation is associated with the project source repository listed in the references.)
/E (A compact desktop scene in Unity is used as a controlled learning environment. It contains a red chair, brown sofa, room elements, a window, simple props, adjustable lighting and on-screen controls. Scene objects are generated procedurally during Play mode. The purpose is to demonstrate and compare selected graphics principles; it is not intended to claim photorealistic material reproduction or complete device-based AR functionality. The implementation is associated with the project source repository listed in the references.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
