188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 72 0 R
/T (Functional features include furniture rendering, selectable lighting modes, separate texture and bump switches, coordinate sliders, an inset-view option and keyboard/mouse input. The non-functional goals are clear presentation, predictable operation, low dependency overhead, reasonable rendering cost and reproducibility in the specified Unity version. A production WebXR application would also need device tracking, object placement, occlusion, camera permissions, performance profiling and accessibility testing; these are beyond the current desktop prototype.)
