/T (For the chair, a strong red base colour and restrained specular response suggest a fabric-like finish. The sofa uses a brown textured base and a more noticeable highlight to imply leather. These settings are illustrative and are not measurements of real furniture. A production AR renderer would need environment-light estimation, consistent shadows, tone mapping and colour matching with the camera image.)
