/T (Ambient illumination prevents areas outside direct light from becoming completely black. It can be represented as the surface albedo multiplied by an ambient-strength value. A modest level helps the chair remain readable in the showroom. In a real AR system, this value should be estimated from the surrounding environment rather than chosen arbitrarily.)
