/T (The chair and sofa use RGB colours and textures. The final displayed colour is influenced by display transfer functions and the rendering colour space. A production renderer may perform lighting in linear space and treat image textures as sRGB data to improve colour compositing. The teaching shader clarifies lighting contributions, but it is not a calibrated system for reproducing the exact colour of real fabric. Consequently, the same red chair may appear different on different displays.)
/E (The chair and sofa use RGB colours and textures. The final displayed colour is influenced by display transfer functions and the rendering colour space. A production renderer may perform lighting in linear space and treat image textures as sRGB data to improve colour compositing. The teaching shader clarifies lighting contributions, but it is not a calibrated system for reproducing the exact colour of real fabric. Consequently, the same red chair may appear different on different displays.)
