<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 76 0 R
/T (The application separates scene construction, user interaction, material shading and screen-coordinate conversion. This separation makes the demonstration easier to understand and troubleshoot. For example, camera movement can be changed without modifying the sofa mesh or its texture, and the viewport marker can be adjusted without changing the lighting shader.)
/E (The application separates scene construction, user interaction, material shading and screen-coordinate conversion. This separation makes the demonstration easier to understand and troubleshoot. For example, camera movement can be changed without modifying the sofa mesh or its texture, and the viewport marker can be adjusted without changing the lighting shader.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
