/T (A furniture preview could mislead a customer if it exaggerates material texture, colour or product dimensions. A reliable retail tool should communicate that lighting and material appearance may be approximate and that results depend on the device. The procedural leather and simplified chair in this project are teaching examples, not scientifically measured reproductions of commercial fabrics. The report therefore distinguishes implemented code, observed Play-mode evidence and proposed future capabilities.)
