/Title (The Unity project is relatively small, shareable as source code and does not depend on external artwork. Its exposed controls make graphics concepts visible instead of hiding them inside a high-level material preset. Students can compare Phong lighting stages, inspect albedo and normal mapping separately, and verify a known viewport coordinate. This makes the application suitable for a short demonstration and for explaining the mathematical ideas behind the three case-study questions.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 868 0 R
