/Title (Normal mapping represents fine leather irregularities using texture samples rather than extra triangles and geometry processing. This shifts some cost to fragment-shader calculations and texture access, which can be useful on mobile GPUs with limited resources. However, large folds, holes and silhouette changes still require real geometry. Normal mapping does not physically move the surface. More accurate production materials may also require PBR shading and textures captured from real materials.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 955 0 R
>>
