<<
/Title (Phong shading is useful for teaching because its ambient, diffuse and specular components are easy to identify. Physically based rendering \(PBR\) uses parameters such as roughness and metallic response, with a stronger emphasis on energy-consistent material behaviour. PBR is generally a better direction for production consistency, while the simpler Phong model is retained here because it directly demonstrates the concepts required by the case study.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 986 0 R
>>
endobj
