1003 0 obj
<<
/Title (A sofa mesh defines the shape of the object, but it does not automatically contain the fine grain associated with leather. Texture mapping places a two-dimensional image over the mesh by assigning UV coordinates to its vertices. The rasterizer interpolates these coordinates across each visible triangle, allowing the fragment shader to sample the appropriate colour from the albedo map.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 997 0 R
/Next 1004 0 R
>>
